From 622bf98e4417e15fb2bf40886a398122f66531d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:21:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media-driver: Remove bogus cmrtlib/proprietary/share include
 dir

Soong refused to build libigfxcmrt: 'module source path
"hardware/intel/external/media/mod/cmrtlib/proprietary/share" does
not exist'.

The 0002 Android.bp regeneration commit (893c80993) added
'proprietary/share' to cmrtlib's local_include_dirs; no such directory
has ever existed anywhere under cmrtlib (confirmed absent both
pre-upgrade and post-upgrade, and via a case-insensitive tree search).
Almost certainly a stale/conditional entry GenerateAndroidBp.py picked
up from the CMake build's include scraping for an optional proprietary
extension that isn't present in this checkout.

Removed the entry; the other 4 cmrtlib/{agnostic,linux}/{share,hardware}
dirs are real and already correctly listed.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 cmrtlib/Android.bp | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/cmrtlib/Android.bp b/cmrtlib/Android.bp
index 4e6cc2541..493ab57dd 100644
--- a/cmrtlib/Android.bp
+++ b/cmrtlib/Android.bp
@@ -40,7 +40,6 @@ cc_library_shared {
     ],
 
     local_include_dirs: [
-        "proprietary/share",
         "agnostic/share",
         "agnostic/hardware",
         "linux/share",
-- 
2.34.1

